  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Realm on a path climbs a fixed ladder from ordinary to supreme grandmaster. Quasi-great grandmaster is the quasi step between grandmaster and great grandmaster. It is not one of the five main levels (ordinary, master, grandmaster, great grandmaster, and supreme grandmaster); those main levels are the rungs the quasi steps sit between.",
      "chapters": [
        687
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_attainment"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Quasi-great grandmaster is only a step away from great grandmaster level. Lady Wan Shou is named as a refinement path quasi-great grandmaster and as one of Northern Plains’ four refinement path experts at that height.",
      "chapters": [
        928
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "one-step-from-great-grandmaster",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_lady_wan_shou",
        "reg_northern_plains"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At this height a cultivator is already proficient in comprehending other paths through the main path. Flood Extremity as a water path quasi-great grandmaster reads a formation’s missing connection that way.",
      "chapters": [
        1270
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "cross-path-reading-begins",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_flood_extremity"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Full great grandmaster goes further, into understanding close to the limits of the world.",
      "chapters": [
        1502
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "cross-path-reading-begins",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Above grandmaster is quasi-great grandmaster, which is even rarer. Holders are often rank seven experts or certain rank eights.",
      "chapters": [
        1326
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rarity-and-rank-band",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Even among refinement path Gu Masters publicly known in Northern Plains, only four stand at that level or higher.",
      "chapters": [
        844
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rarity-and-rank-band",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_gu_masters"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Dream realms can lift a path into this step. After the second stage of Thieving Heaven’s dream realm, Fang Yuan’s theft path rises to quasi-great grandmaster, leaving him one step from genuine great grandmaster.",
      "chapters": [
        1502
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "dream-realm-raise",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_dream_realm",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The full ladder is on Attainment. Neighboring steps include grandmaster attainment and great grandmaster. Dao marks and how they relate to attainment are on Dao Marks and Attainment.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "dream-realm-raise",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_dao_marks"
      ]
    }
  ],
